### 1. Ping / Latency Test
GET https://8080.frankgp.com/ping

### 2. Health Check Status
GET https://8080.frankgp.com/health

### 3. Download Speed Test (10 MB)
GET https://8080.frankgp.com/download?bytes=10000000

### 4. Download Speed Test Small (1 MB)
GET https://8080.frankgp.com/download?bytes=1000000

### 5. Upload Speed Test (POST dummy payload)
POST https://8080.frankgp.com/upload
Content-Type: application/octet-stream

This is a test payload for measuring upload bandwidth on the Go speedtest server.

### 6. CORS Options Preflight Check
OPTIONS https://8080.frankgp.com/ping

---

### Local Server Testing (http://localhost:8080)

### Local Ping
GET http://localhost:8080/ping

### Local Health Check
GET http://localhost:8080/health

### Local Download
GET http://localhost:8080/download?bytes=1000000

### Local Upload
POST http://localhost:8080/upload
Content-Type: application/octet-stream

Testing local upload bandwidth to Go speedtest server.
